on_name": "wedding.mtn", "touch_area": "", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|HK433|SOULCONTRACT", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"1150101": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "1150102": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "1150103": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "1150104": {"char_code": "HK433", "voice_key": "OPERATIONOVER", "caption": "Now that the walk is over, can I get back to work?"}, "1150105": {"char_code": "HK433", "voice_key": "SKILL2", "caption": "Behold the results of 10000 years of training!"}, "1150106": {"char_code": "HK433", "voice_key": "SKILL3", "caption": "I am the most perfect."}, "1150107": {"char_code": "HK433", "voice_key": "GOATTACK", "caption": "Battle is the best way to test one's strength."}, "1150108": {"char_code": "HK433", "voice_key": "FORMATION", "caption": "Everyone, eyes on me."}, "1150109": {"char_code": "HK433", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "A kitty ornament?! Ah, it's not like I don't like them, but if I carried one on me, my teammates would question my professional competence, would they not? ...What? It's a sign of your favor? ...Ahem, that IS quite a cunning tactic. Oh well, since you've said so, I shall gladly accept."}, "1150110": {"char_code": "HK433", "voice_key": "GAIN", "caption": "I am Gr HK433. Nice to meet you, Commander. I'll make sure you remember me."}, "1150111": {"char_code": "HK433", "voice_key": "MOOD2", "caption": ""}, "1150112": {"char_code": "HK433", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "I have been waiting for this moment for too long... <> After tens of thousands of hours of effort, I finally understand now that rather than hearing things like \"I need your strength\", I'd rather receive your pure affections. <> Thank you. Even though I didn't say anything, you still managed to see through want I wanted. <> In that case, will you take care of the real me in between battles, for all the days to come?"}}}